.TH ASCII 1 "28th of July 2026" "zenithutils" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
ascii - print the ascii table

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ascii

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBascii\fP prints the 128 characters of the ascii table on 4 (17-char wide) columns and 33 lines.
This is not unlike busybox's version of ascii

.SH OPTIONS
No options
